    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-59#art_154> .

<https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-59#art_154_obligation_1_0cf8d644_role_47bc49b257> a dznorm:Role ;
