<https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-59#art_338_condition_6_2dd7a668> a dznorm:Condition ;
    dzdoc:hasReference <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-59#art_338_condition_6_2dd7a668_ref_b1dea318e3f4>,
