    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-59#art_578> .

<https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-59#art_578_obligation_0_7710cb6f_role_35d11ada71> a dznorm:Role ;
